{"id":"c64ec89ea811abf4","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-cross-no-splitting.md","title":"两个前缀上无交叉不同的共同输出","display":"lem-cross-no-splitting — 两个前缀上无交叉不同的共同输出","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-cross-no-splitting","aliases":["20-lem-cross-no-splitting"],"display":"lem-cross-no-splitting — 两个前缀上无交叉不同的共同输出","chapter":"6","section":"6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemma 6.2.5 的双指标形式","source_printed_pages":[135],"source_pdf_pages":[169],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-cross-no-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-cross-no-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-cross-no-splitting — 两个前缀上无交叉不同的共同输出"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 6.2.5 的双指标形式"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>135</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\succeq\\sigma\">\\(A\\succeq\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\succeq\\tau\">\\(B\\succeq\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\Phi_i^A=\\Phi_j^B\">\\(f=\\Phi_i^A=\\Phi_j^B\\)</span> 为全函数。不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma,\\nu\\succeq\\tau,x\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\sigma,\\nu\\succeq\\tau,x\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_i^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_j^\\nu(x)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_i^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_j^\\nu(x)\\downarrow\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cross\\text{-}no\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cross\\text{-}no\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的有限延伸上搜索第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个程序的第一个停止输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>。真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 保证搜索停止。真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 也有某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\succeq\\tau\">\\(\\nu\\succeq\\tau\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>；无交叉不同的假设迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=f(x)\">\\(y=f(x)\\)</span>。于是只含有限参数的普通搜索计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。这是原书同指标引理的直接双指标展开，便于在不调用 Posner 合并时使用。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 6.2.5 的双指标形式；印刷页 135；PDF 第 169 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\succeq\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"B\\succeq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\Phi_i^A=\\Phi_j^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma,\\nu\\succeq\\tau,x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_i^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_j^\\nu(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cross\\text{-}no\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\succeq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"y=f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1677,"backlinks":[{"id":"c889f5ceee2ae9fa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]；see [[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]] — 章 6；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","140cce30ee9c16d1","e343870c773cb68e"]}